{"id":"5171","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5171_main_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-perlucidus-undulatus-radiatus-and-cumulus-fractus-fluctus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在这片大范围层积云层（成层云种）中的长卷轴（波状云类）似乎正在聚向<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">地平线附近（辐辏状云类）</span>的一个点。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在卷轴之间的极小间隙（漏隙云类）</span>中可直接看到上方的蓝天。这些小间隙还可显露出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">太阳的位置</span>，但卷轴非常厚，足以将其遮蔽（蔽光云类）。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">散落的灰色小云</span>为碎积云。它们的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">边缘破碎</span>，大部分有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">略圆的顶</span>。其中的一个云在其上部后缘呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波涛状附加特征（卷波或碎波）</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tsz Cheung Lee","location":"中国香港，湾仔新渡轮码头","latitude":"纬度: 22° 17' 2'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 10' 31'' E","date":"15 December 2012 1455 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南西南","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.7.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.7.11"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5171_syn_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-perlucidus-undulatus-radiatus-and-cumulus-fractus-fluctus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>浅湿向岸气流当天影响了中国广东沿海。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5171_upper_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-perlucidus-undulatus-radiatus-and-cumulus-fractus-fluctus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从600米到1400米轻逆温底（1.8℃）的相对湿度层大于90％RH</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5486_main_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>灰色云层完全遮盖天空，但仍有一些较亮的部分，这在层状层积云中常见。云层很厚，看不到太阳，因此，它属于蔽光云类。云底有波纹，表明另一种云类：波状。其波纹充分加大，因此，或许可将其归类为糙面云附加特征。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Hernàn Palmisciano","location":"阿根廷，布宜诺斯艾利斯市，卡巴利托","latitude":"纬度: 34° 37' 7'' S","longitude":"经度: 58° 25' 43'' W","date":"01 November 2014 1733 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 5, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.7.11 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.7.11 1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5829_main_stratocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus-and-lower-cumulus-fractus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>图为一层相当巨大且通常<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">有层积云属典型的灰色云素</span>；它还有与成层云种有关的相对扁平的云底。该云还是蔽光云类，因为它<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">很蔽光，可完全遮蔽太阳</span>。最引人注目的特征是一系列<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波浪，大致平行排列</span>，因此可补充确定为波状云类。波浪与云高度的风向垂直。背景中是少量有小圆顶的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">晴天碎积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Sung Lok Cheung","location":"中国，香港，天水围","latitude":"纬度: 22° 27' 38'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 0' 15'' E","date":"27 January 2016 1201 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北西北","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.7.11 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.7.11 2"}]}]}